{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1456353-inspiration-for-changeling-folklore","id":1456353,"title":"Inspiration for Changeling folklore","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-08-08T11:05:26-07:00","id":1456353,"title":"Inspiration for Changeling folklore","content":"What I was always disappointed about from Chronicles of Darkness/ The God Machine Chronicles and miss from classic World of Darkness is that we were never introduced to reinterpretations of some of our famous heroes and villains of folklore. This is especially true for Changeling the Lost since Changelings are supposed to be famous fairytale heroes and villains. I have done previous threads with ideas for reinterpreting some famous fairy tale characters as Changelings.<br /> <br /> I have found two series that give ideas for reinterpretations of some of our most famous folktales.<br /> <br /> In this twisted version of the popular folktale of Robinhood, the Sheriff of Nottingham hunts a serial killer known has <i>Hood</i>. At the same time, he finds himself used as a chess piece by the England\u2019s power brokers, while trying to foil the schemes of the Merry Men?<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://readcomicsonline.ru/comic/nottingham-2021/1\" target=\"_blank\">Nottingham (2021-) Chapter 1 - Page 1 (readcomicsonline.ru)</a><br /> <br /> When a cult of nationalist plan to resurrect King Arthur, return the Isle\u2019s to the time of legends, and bring doom to modern England Bridgette Mcguire drags her unsuspecting grandson into a world of legends, man eating monsters, and undead kings. While trying to save Britain, Duncan must wrestle with the fact that much of his youth and family life was based on a lie. Can he forgive his grandmother, while trying not to be eaten by monsters?<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://readcomicsonline.ru/comic/once-and-future-2019/1\" target=\"_blank\">Once And Future (2019-) Chapter 1 - Page 1 (readcomicsonline.ru)</a><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-08T15:49:17-07:00","id":1456374,"title":"","content":"In a previous thread, I shared my idea for Alice Liddell as a changeling (I am actually still hopeful that we will see major fairy tale characters introduced as changelings). A major source for this idea (Along with the original duology by Lewis Carol) was the video game, <b><i>American McGee's Alice: Madness Returns.</i></b><br /> <br /> You can watch all the cut scenes here:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UHH8HRtjl-o\" target=\"_blank\">Alice: Madness Returns Game Movie (All Cutscenes) 1080p HD - YouTube</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-09T06:07:38-07:00","id":1456420,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Sharing pirated material in these forums is prohibited. </span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+